<div class="WordSection1">

<!-- ═══════════════════ COVER ═══════════════════ -->
<h1>SportBridge</h1>
<p class="tagline">Verified Sports Talent Platform &mdash; Full System Overview</p>

<div class="key-points">
  <p>&#x1F512; <strong>All contact through secure inbox</strong> &mdash; no phone numbers or emails ever shown publicly</p>
  <p>&#x2705; <strong>6 roles</strong> &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; <strong>5 languages</strong> (EN / FR / PT / AR / ES) &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Verified badges (human-reviewed)</p>
  <p>&#x1F4CD; Demo site: <strong>sportbridge.netlify.app</strong> &nbsp;&#183;&nbsp; Production: <strong>sportbridge.online</strong></p>
</div>

<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- ═══════════════════ SECTION 1: ROLES ═══════════════════ -->
<h2>1. User Roles &amp; All Capabilities</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width:18%">Role</th>
      <th style="width:57%">All Capabilities</th>
      <th style="width:25%">Limits</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-name">&#x1F3C3; Player</span><br><span class="subroles">Free forever</span></td>
      <td>
        Public profile &middot; video &amp; CV upload &middot; match results (goals, assists, minutes) &middot;
        upcoming matches &amp; tournaments &middot; achievements &amp; milestones &middot;
        apply for jobs &middot; express interest in tryouts &middot;
        <span class="highlight">access request management (approve/deny agents)</span> &middot;
        Community Feed posts &middot; 30-min live sessions &middot;
        secure inbox &middot; get verified (NIN or passport) &middot; report any profile
      </td>
      <td class="limit">
        Live sessions max 30 min &middot;
        Cannot post jobs or tryouts directly &middot;
        Contact details only shown after player approves agent access
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="even">
      <td><span class="role-name">&#x1F4CB; Coach / Manager</span><br><span class="subroles">35 sub-roles incl. Head Coach, Sporting Director, Technical Director, Fitness Coach, Goalkeeping Coach, U18/U23 Coach, Loan Manager and more</span></td>
      <td>
        Full coaching profile (preferred role from 35 options) &middot; badges &amp; licences &middot;
        upload CV &middot; apply for coaching &amp; director jobs &middot;
        <span class="highlight">recommend players to agents &amp; clubs</span> &middot;
        <span class="highlight">recommend players with video / CV attached</span> &middot;
        post upcoming events &amp; tournaments &middot;
        post earned certificates (UEFA, CAF, FIFA, FA) &middot;
        post tournament tryouts &middot; post match results &middot;
        Community Feed &middot; secure inbox &middot; get verified &middot; report any profile
      </td>
      <td class="limit">
        No direct player contact without player approval &middot;
        Cannot modify player profiles &middot;
        Paid tryouts go to admin review
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-name">&#x1F52D; Agent / Scout</span><br><span class="subroles">FIFA-verified agents &amp; scouts</span></td>
      <td>
        Agency profile (name, regions, specialisation) &middot; upload CV &middot;
        <span class="highlight">search full player directory</span> (filter: position, age, region, nationality, foot) &middot;
        <span class="highlight">player watchlist</span> &middot; send access requests to players &middot;
        post Player Needed jobs &middot; post tryout opportunities &middot;
        post upcoming events &amp; certificates &middot;
        browse &amp; apply for agent / scout / director roles &middot;
        receive player recommendations from coaches &amp; analysts &middot;
        Community Feed &middot; secure inbox &middot; get verified (FIFA Agents ID) &middot; report any profile
      </td>
      <td class="limit">
        Player contact only after player approval &middot;
        Paid tryouts held for admin approval &middot;
        Cannot edit player data
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="even">
      <td><span class="role-name">&#x1F3DF;&#xFE0F; Academy / Club</span><br><span class="subroles">Verified clubs &amp; academies (CAC / FA registered)</span></td>
      <td>
        Club profile (country, address, year founded, sports) &middot;
        <span class="highlight">squad roster management</span> (add players with admin-approved documents) &middot;
        post Player Needed jobs &middot; post Staff Needed jobs &middot;
        post match results with goals, assists &amp; scorers &middot;
        post upcoming fixtures &amp; tournaments &middot; post player highlights &middot;
        post free &amp; paid trials &middot;
        <span class="highlight">recommend players with video / CV</span> &middot;
        Community Feed &middot; secure inbox &middot; get verified (CAC / company registration) &middot; report any profile
      </td>
      <td class="limit">
        Roster additions require admin review of identity + contract documents &middot;
        Paid tryouts admin-reviewed &middot;
        Cannot view player private CV without approval
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="role-name">&#x1F4CA; Sports Analyst</span><br><span class="subroles">7 specialisations: Performance &middot; Video &middot; Data &middot; Recruitment &middot; Tactical &middot; Opposition &middot; Head of Analysis</span></td>
      <td>
        Analyst profile (specialisation, tools: Wyscout, StatsBomb, Python, R) &middot;
        upload CV &amp; analysis portfolio &middot;
        <span class="highlight">apply for analyst roles</span> &middot;
        <span class="highlight">find players in directory</span> &middot; recommend players &middot;
        <span class="highlight">recommend players with video / CV</span> &middot;
        post match analyses &amp; tactical reviews &middot;
        post upcoming courses, workshops &amp; training &middot;
        post earned certificates (Wyscout, StatsBomb IQ, UEFA Analysis) &middot;
        share publications &amp; reports to Community Feed &middot;
        secure inbox &middot; get verified &middot; report any profile
      </td>
      <td class="limit">
        Same contact limits as Coach &middot;
        Cannot post tryouts independently &middot;
        No direct player contact without approval
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="even">
      <td><span class="role-name">&#x1F6E1;&#xFE0F; Super Admin</span><br><span class="subroles">Full platform control</span></td>
      <td>
        View all accounts (search by name, email, role, location) &middot;
        view role distribution &amp; staff roles breakdown &middot;
        change any user&rsquo;s role &middot; suspend or restore any account &middot;
        verification queue (approve / reject with notes) &middot;
        reports &amp; disputes queue (investigate, confirm, dismiss) &middot;
        3-party notifications on all outcomes &middot;
        duplicate file detector (SHA-256) &middot;
        fee-flagged tryout review &middot; view verification statistics &middot;
        latest members with sub-roles shown
      </td>
      <td class="limit">
        Cannot permanently delete accounts &middot;
        Confirming scam sets account to &ldquo;denied&rdquo; &mdash; data and history preserved
      </td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- ═══════════════════ SECTION 2: REPORTS ═══════════════════ -->
<h2>2. Reports &amp; Disputes System</h2>

<div class="flow-box">
  <p><strong>Any user can report any other profile at any time.</strong></p>
  <p>Five report reasons: Scam / Fraud &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Fake profile &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Harassment &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Inappropriate content &nbsp;&middot;&nbsp; Other</p>
  <p><strong>Flow:</strong> User files report &rarr; Admin + reported user + reporter all notified &rarr; Admin investigates &rarr; Confirms scam (account denied) or Dismisses &rarr; All parties notified on outcome</p>
  <p><em>Reporter identity is always kept confidential from the reported user.</em></p>
</div>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width:22%">When</th>
      <th style="width:28%">Who Gets Notified</th>
      <th>Message</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Report filed</td><td>All Super Admins</td><td>New report filed against [name]: [reason]</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Report filed</td><td>Reported user</td><td>A report has been filed against your profile and is under review</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Report filed</td><td>Reporter</td><td>Your report has been received &mdash; review within 48 hours</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Admin investigates</td><td>Reporter</td><td>Your report is now under active investigation</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Scam confirmed</td><td>Reporter + Reported user</td><td>Account actioned / Your account has been actioned</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Report dismissed</td><td>Reporter + Reported user</td><td>No action taken / Report dismissed &mdash; you are cleared</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- ═══════════════════ SECTION 3: RULES ═══════════════════ -->
<h2>3. Platform Rules</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width:35%">Rule</th>
      <th>Detail</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>&#x1F6AB; No contact info in public fields</td>
      <td>Phone numbers and email addresses are automatically blocked in all public text fields (bio, achievements, captions, match updates)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="even">
      <td>&#x1F4EC; All contact via secure inbox</td>
      <td>No phone numbers or emails ever shown anywhere. Every interaction goes through the platform inbox.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>&#x1F4B3; No payment requests</td>
      <td>Agents and scouts cannot charge players. Requests flagged automatically and sent to admin review.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="even">
      <td>&#x2705; Verified badge = human reviewed</td>
      <td>Badges are not automatic. An admin reviews and approves all submitted identity and licence documents.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>&#x1F4B0; Paid tryouts admin-reviewed</td>
      <td>All fee-bearing tryout posts are held in admin moderation queue before going live on the platform.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="even">
      <td>&#x1F3AC; Full-match video required</td>
      <td>Players must upload at least one video classified as &ldquo;Full Match&rdquo; before verification can be approved.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>&#x1F510; Password minimum 12 characters</td>
      <td>Enforced at registration. Auth errors do not distinguish unknown accounts from wrong passwords.</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="even">
      <td>&#x1F4C1; SHA-256 duplicate detection</td>
      <td>Duplicate file uploads are flagged automatically and visible to the admin in the Duplicates tab.</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- ═══════════════════ SECTION 4: STACK ═══════════════════ -->
<h2>4. Technical Stack</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th style="width:20%">Layer</th>
      <th style="width:35%">Technology</th>
      <th>Responsibility</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Frontend</td><td>React 19, Vite 8, Bootstrap 5</td><td>All UI &mdash; dashboards, profiles, search, feed</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Database</td><td>Supabase PostgreSQL</td><td>Profiles, players, clubs, jobs, reports, notifications</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Auth</td><td>Supabase Auth + Brevo SMTP</td><td>Registration, sign-in, email confirmation</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Authorization</td><td>Row-Level Security (RLS)</td><td>Ownership, role permissions, admin-only access</td></tr>
    <tr><td>File Storage</td><td>Supabase Storage</td><td>Videos, CVs, photos, identity documents</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Hosting</td><td>Netlify</td><td>Demo site (sportbridge.netlify.app)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Languages</td><td>English, Fran&ccedil;ais, Portugu&ecirc;s, &#x0627;&#x0644;&#x0639;&#x0631;&#x0628;&#x064A;&#x0629;, Espa&ntilde;ol</td><td>Full interface translation incl. RTL for Arabic</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Deployment</td><td>GitHub Actions CI/CD</td><td>Automated build &amp; deploy on every push to main</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<hr class="section-divider">

