<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- ═══════════════════ SECTION 6: MEMBERS DIRECTORY ═══════════════════ -->
<h2>6. Members Directory</h2>

<p>The Members Directory allows any logged-in user to browse and discover verified professionals across four categories:</p>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th style="width:20%">Tab</th><th>Who Is Shown</th><th>Profile Contains</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>&#x1F4CB; Coaches</td><td>All public coach profiles</td><td>Name, preferred role, nationality, experience, current club, UEFA/CAF licences, open to work status</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>&#x1F52D; Agents</td><td>All public agent profiles</td><td>Agency name, regions covered, experience, nationalities, about &amp; achievements</td></tr>
    <tr><td>&#x1F3DF;&#xFE0F; Clubs</td><td>All public clubs &amp; academies</td><td>Club name, country, year founded, sports, verified badge status</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>&#x1F4CA; Analysts</td><td>All public sports analyst profiles</td><td>Name, specialisation, tools used, open-to-work status, certifications</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- ═══════════════════ SECTION 7: VERIFICATION ═══════════════════ -->
<h2>7. Verification Process</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th style="width:20%">Role</th><th>Documents Required</th><th>Admin Action</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Player</td><td>NIN or passport (clear photo)</td><td>Review &rarr; Approve/Reject with notes</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Coach</td><td>Licence certificates (UEFA/CAF/FA/FIFA)</td><td>Review &rarr; Approve/Reject with notes</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Agent</td><td>FIFA Agents licence or national equivalent</td><td>Review &rarr; Approve/Reject with notes</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Academy / Club</td><td>CAC registration or FA club licence</td><td>Review &rarr; Approve/Reject with notes</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Sports Analyst</td><td>University degree or professional certificate</td><td>Review &rarr; Approve/Reject with notes</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p>All approved accounts receive a blue verified badge &#x2705; visible on their public profile and in the Members Directory. Verification is not automatic &mdash; an admin must review and approve every submission.</p>

<hr class="section-divider">

<!-- ═══════════════════ SECTION 8: LANGUAGES ═══════════════════ -->
<h2>8. Languages &amp; Localisation</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Language</th><th>Code</th><th>Direction</th><th>Coverage</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>English</td><td>en</td><td>LTR</td><td>Full (default)</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>Fran&ccedil;ais (French)</td><td>fr</td><td>LTR</td><td>Full</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Portugu&ecirc;s (Portuguese)</td><td>pt</td><td>LTR</td><td>Full</td></tr>
    <tr class="even"><td>&#x0627;&#x0644;&#x0639;&#x0631;&#x0628;&#x064A;&#x0629; (Arabic)</td><td>ar</td><td>RTL</td><td>Full (RTL layout)</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Espa&ntilde;ol (Spanish)</td><td>es</td><td>LTR</td><td>Full</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p>The language selector is shown in the top navigation bar on every page. Selected language persists across sessions via localStorage. All dashboard tabs, form labels, error messages, notifications and role descriptions are translated.</p>

